{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2016-02", "window": 2, "start_date": 1454889600, "end_date": 1455494399, "month_true_total": 228, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:11:09 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "21218037", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014159484", "personaname": "emperor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/borkinafaso/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 3955, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1167, "last_played": 1713300733, "avatar": "278d6d42282f13b0a6a3943cb7c4fedd920c98e3"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the best game I have ever bought considering fun/price ratio.\n\n♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ of items, a wide variety of characters that are very different in playstyle. Tense, unforgiving gameplay that challenges the player and forces them to get better. Unlocks and achievements that are actually fun to get, instead of relying on lazy grindfests. On top of that, there's a bunch of artifacts to find that significantly change the course of game and make it either harder, more complex or simply ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ insane. Even the graphics, while simple, are really pretty and you can see there was a lot of heart put into work in that department.\n\nThe only downside to this game is online support - sometimes you can connect to the lobby, sometimes you can't. There's a lot of work with portforwarding and such, but Evolve makes it work like a charm (Hamachi didn't work, not sure about Tunngle).\n\nJust buy it already. It's cheap and worth every penny.", "timestamp_created": 1455487977, "timestamp_updated": 1455487977, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.539622604846954346", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions"